    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main_1010_sys_01",
      "hash": "1651f10d6b07e451",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main_1010_sys_02",
      "hash": "1651ee0d6b07df38",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_04",
      "hash": "313c7eb68af79e19",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 7]"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_01",
      "hash": "27012684004f6025",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "This Lapras is getting on in age, but it’s still\\na real beauty, wouldn’t you say?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_09",
      "hash": "27012e84004f6dbd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "We used to ride on waves and travel the whole\\nwide world together!"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main1010_poke_n_01",
      "hash": "0fbf99abdfd06be7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "LAPRAS: Splaaash!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_02",
      "hash": "27012384004f5b0c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Lapras can’t swim like it used to...\\c\\nSo we’ll stay here together."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_03",
      "hash": "27012484004f5cbf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Thank you for listening."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_10",
      "hash": "2704ab84005277fb",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "As thanks, I’ll teach you the [VAR COLOR(0006)]Secret Technique[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]Sea Skim[VAR COLOR(0000)].\\r\\nWith this technique, you can travel on water!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_04",
      "hash": "27012184004f57a6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Haha! Your [VAR POKNAME(0002)] wants to learn it\\nas well?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_11",
      "hash": "2704aa8400527648",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I’m not sure if it can learn it.\\nIt’s not Water type..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main1010_partner_a_01",
      "hash": "f1cf0975034c2acf",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pikapi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main1010_partner_b_01",
      "hash": "f30a517a2a59c078",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Eeeveee!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_05",
      "hash": "27012284004f5959",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You look determined, just like my Lapras!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_12",
      "hash": "2704ad8400527b61",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "OK! I’ll teach you the technique, then!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main1010_partner_a_02",
      "hash": "f1cf0a75034c2c82",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Pikapi!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main1010_partner_b_02",
      "hash": "f30a547a2a59c591",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Veee!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_06",
      "hash": "27011f84004f5440",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "...Now, you have to keep balance on the water!\\c\\nLower the center of gravity, and keep balance\\nwith your upper body!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main1010_sys_n_01",
      "hash": "5b153dffd0bef2dd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0003)] learned the [VAR COLOR(0006)]Secret Technique[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]Sea Skim[VAR COLOR(0000)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_07",
      "hash": "27012084004f55f3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "You did great!\\c\\nI’ll give you that board, too!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_13",
      "hash": "2704ac84005279ae",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Ride waves and travel the whole wide\\nworld together!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "msg_main1010_muscle_n_08",
      "hash": "27012d84004f6c0a",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I hope you and [VAR POKNAME(0002)] will stay good\\nfriends for a long time!"
    }
  ],
